    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to bring to the market this wonderful four-bedroom semi-detached property, ideally situated within a popular and mature residential development in Killarney.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive home is ready for immediate occupation. The property has been exceptionally well cared for and is presented to a great standard, both internally and externally.\r\n\r\nThe outdoor space is equally impressive, with the property occupying a generous and private site. The garden provides excellent privacy and offers significant potential for further extend if required.  \r\n\r\nThe location is superb, being within easy walking distance of all the amenities Killarney has to offer, including a wide selection of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and local services.\r\n\r\nThis excellent starter home combines generous living accommodation, a superb private setting and a convenient location within a well-established residential area.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 3.25m x 1.47m \r\nTile floor, centre light, wooden front door with glazing. \r\n\r\nHallway - 3.15m x 1.88m \r\nTile floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.5m x 3.51m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light. \r\n\r\nGround Floor Bedroom - 3.35m x 2.44m \r\nCapet floor, centre light. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.5m x 1.88m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 4.95m x 3.63m \r\nTile floor fitted kitchen unit with integrated, hob and overhead extractor unit, sliding door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUtility - 2.49m x 1.4m \r\nTile floor, fitted units, plumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.21m x 3.96m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, hot press unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.56m x 3.99m \r\nCarpet floor, cenrte light, built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.06m x 2.44m \r\nTile floor and wall, WC, WHB, power shower unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.45m x 2.77m \r\nCarpet floor, built-in wardrobe unit, centre light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.47m x 3.33m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, built-in wardrobe unit. \n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.21m x 2.18m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, bath unit. \r\n\r\n"
